stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Loading
    Loading --> Ready: first read succeeds
    Loading --> Unavailable: first read fails
    Ready --> Refreshing: refresh from null cursor
    Refreshing --> Stale: temporary failure
    Stale --> Refreshing: retry from null cursor
    Refreshing --> Ready: replace listing, including empty
    Ready --> More: load next page
    More --> Ready: append validated page
    More --> Unavailable: retain data and cursor
    Unavailable --> More: retry same cursor
    Unavailable --> Loading: retry first read
    Ready --> Ready: toggle identity disclosure
    Refreshing --> Expired: 401 / 403 / invalidation
    Stale --> Expired: invalidation
    More --> Expired: invalidation
    Ready --> Expired: invalidation
    Loading --> Disposed: dispose or switch deal
    Refreshing --> Disposed: dispose or switch deal
    Stale --> Disposed: dispose or switch deal
    Disposed --> Disposed: ignore late completion
    Expired --> Expired: ignore late completion
